## Breach Notification

### Notification Timeline

| Event | Timeline | Recipient |
|-------|----------|-----------|
| Discovery of Breach | Day 0 | Internal assessment |
| Internal Assessment | 24-48 hours | Legal, Security |
| CE Notification | Per BAA (24-72 hours) | Covered Entity |
| Documentation | 72 hours | Compliance records |

### Notification Content

MedSync will provide:
- Nature of the breach
- Types of PHI involved
- Individuals known to be affected
- Steps taken to investigate
- Mitigation measures
- Contact information

### Notification Methods

| Priority | Method |
|----------|--------|
| Primary | Email to designated contact |
| Secondary | Phone call |
| Tertiary | Written notice |

